{"id":"186aad749d027077","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-injective.md","title":"Injective","display":"df-injective — Injective","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-injective","aliases":["88-df-injective"],"display":"df-injective — Injective","depends_on":["[[88-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-injective"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-injective</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-injective — Injective"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in V\">\\(A,B\\in V\\)</span> (sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span> (candidate graph)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9041d99d4fa03d32\" href=\"?note=9041d99d4fa03d32\" title=\"88-df-function\">88-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (injection predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B) \\land \\forall x_1,x_2 \\in A\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2) \\to x_1=x_2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B) \\land \\forall x_1,x_2 \\in A\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2) \\to x_1=x_2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Functionhood is required by the definiens rather than assumed in advance, so\nthe predicate also rejects nonfunctions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9041d99d4fa03d32","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"9041d99d4fa03d32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[88-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}injective} \\vdash \\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,A,B) \\land \\forall x_1,x_2 \\in A\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2) \\to x_1=x_2)","display":true}],"bytes":736,"backlinks":[{"id":"1fd20a9a341b65d3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injective}$ (injection predicate, see [[88-df-injective]])"},{"id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injective}(f,A,B)$ (injection predicate, see [[88-df-injective]])"},{"id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Coding},\\mathrm{WordCoding}$ 是本文件定义的规范编码谓词；$\\mathrm{Injective}$ 见 [[88-df-injective]]。"},{"id":"ecf74ed22706d6a5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":[